OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories about
OL,8,Fpeople, places and animals across our
OL,9,Fregion - and we like to shout about
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThis week, we're featuring a husband
OL,13,Fdonating a kidney to his wife, a
OL,14,F106-year-old woman inundated with
OL,15,Fbirthday cards, and an inclusive
OL,16,Frunning club.
OL,18,FThe clock in Ripon Grammar School's
OL,19,Fstriking clock tower, which dates back
OL,20,Fto 1889, is not believed to have worked
OL,21,Fproperly for decades.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
